        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.98,
          "end": 22.403,
          "en": "in one and the same app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.29,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "Now don't get me wrong,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 27.11,
          "en": "you of course don't need to combine navigators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.11,
          "end": 28.97,
          "en": "And especially, the stack navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.97,
          "end": 32.69,
          "en": "is a super common type of navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.69,
          "end": 35.37,
          "en": "but sometimes you wanna have certain patterns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.37,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "certain features in a app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 40.693,
          "en": "that require the combination of navigators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.61,
          "end": 44.64,
          "en": "And indeed, with React Navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.64,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "nesting navigators and combining navigators is quite simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 52.13,
          "en": "You could, for example, have one set of screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.13,
          "end": 55.06,
          "en": "that's combined in a stack navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.06,
          "end": 57.85,
          "en": "then another screen which are then combined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.85,
          "end": 60.86,
          "en": "with a common drawer navigator above them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.86,
          "end": 63.46,
          "en": "That's not the exact setup we built,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.46,
          "end": 65.713,
          "en": "but That is something you could build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.83,
          "end": 69.88,
          "en": "And indeed, in this app which we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.88,
          "end": 71.42,
          "en": "we will build it such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.42,
          "end": 74.45,
          "en": "that we actually will have a drawer navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.45,
          "end": 77.27,
          "en": "on this main screen here so that we can then choose",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.27,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "to go either to this categories screen here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 84.07,
          "en": "or to a favorite screen which we have yet to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.07,
          "end": 86.06,
          "en": "Because we have this favorites icon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.06,
          "end": 88.22,
          "en": "which to doesn't do anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.22,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "but if this would be a real app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 91.55,
          "en": "we might be able to add favorites here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 91.55,
          "end": 94.06,
          "en": "And then, it would probably make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.06,
          "end": 97.55,
          "en": "to have some favorites page to which we can go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.55,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "And I wanna go to that page with help of a drawer navigator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 102.863,
          "en": "on that starting screen.",
