        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.37,
          "end": 112.35,
          "en": "we will have to install the drawer navigator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.35,
          "end": 116.2,
          "en": "we'll have to add a dummy favorite screen for a start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.2,
          "end": 120.35,
          "en": "and then we can see how we can combine these navigators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.35,
          "end": 122.88,
          "en": "Now let's start with setting everything up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.88,
          "end": 124.95,
          "en": "For this, we first of all have to install",
